# llm-bridge v0.1.0 | rust/tauri
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
▸ Proxy:    cargo run -p llm-bridge-cli -- serve
▸ Info:     cargo run -p llm-bridge-cli -- info
▸ App dev:  cd app/src-tauri && cargo tauri dev
▸ Test:     cargo test --workspace
▸ Lint:     cargo fmt --check && cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings
▸ Deny:     cargo deny check
▸ Release:  git tag v<version> && git push upstream v<version>
